<div class="text-center">
    <p>最後一步！在此您可以編輯額外的版面設定以及/或儲存您的設計(Last Step! Here you can edit additional layout settings and/or save your design.)。</p>
    <p>準備就緒後，請點擊「下載」以產生標籤。如果您要下載非常大量的標籤，系統將提供分批下載的選項(When you are ready, click 'download' to generate your labels. If you are trying to download a very large set, you will be given the option to download your labels in batches.)。</p>
</div>
</br>
<div class="col-md-12" id="save_and_download">
    <div class="col-md-4" style="margin-top:40px;">
        <center>
        <br>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" id="edit_additional_settings">編輯額外設定(Edit Additional Settings)</button>
        </center>
    </div></br></br>
    <div class="col-md-4" style="margin-top:40px;">
        <center>
            <label>儲存標籤設計(Save label design):</label>
            <div class="input-group" id="save_design_div">
                <input type="text" id="save_design_name" class="form-control" placeholder="輸入名稱(Enter a name)"></input>
                <span class="input-group-btn">
                    <button class="btn btn-default" id="d3-save-button" type="button">儲存(Save)</button>
                </span>
            </div>
        </center>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4" style="margin-top:40px;">
      <center>
          <br>
          <button id="d3-pdf-button" value="pdf" class="btn btn-primary" style="display:none;">下載 PDF(Download pdf)</button>
          <button id="d3-zpl-button" value="zpl" class="btn btn-primary" style="display:none;">下載 ZPL 檔案(Download zpl file)</button>
      </center>
      &nbsp
      &nbsp
    </div>
</div>
